      "writtenOn": "2026-04-08T05:59:46Z",
      "side": 1,
      "message": "Maybe you can check if there is any inconsistency in the protection e.g bank 0 protectec, bank 1 unprotected and bank 2 protected again?",
      "revId": "abc5fe520eeb4fa78aa11da4a1dd09581b478c6f",
      "serverId": "3ce6091f-6c88-37e8-8c75-72f92ae8dfba"
